{"k":{"t01-apar-0":"<span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"12.6pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">说明手册</span> <span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"8.4pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">附于</span> <span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"15.6pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">德尔马辅助挂图</span> <span class=\"orn\">❦</span> <span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"13.2pt\" data-rolo=\"serio\">第一组</span> <span class=\"fil\"></span>","t01-apar-1":"<span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"15.0pt\" data-rolo=\"nom\">图表第 1 号</span> <span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"11.4pt\" data-rolo=\"tit\">学校。— 中学。— 教室。</span> <span class=\"fil\"></span>","t01-tit-1":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">总的描述。</span>","t01-01-1":"1. — 这幅图表画的是一所<b>中学</b>里的<b>教室</b>。教室里有八张 <b>课桌</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.339325,0.560105,0.009987,0.010154\" data-n=\"18\" title=\"课桌\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(18)</sup></button> 和八条<b>长凳</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.298491,0.886341,0.009543,0.012447\" data-n=\"32\" title=\"长凳\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(32)</sup></button>。每条长凳 上坐三个学生。<b>老师</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.104527,0.503767,0.004882,0.010481\" data-n=\"7\" title=\"老师\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(7)</sup></button> 坐在<b>椅子</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.072792,0.542745,0.00466,0.012119\" data-n=\"8\" title=\"椅子\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(8)</sup></button> 上，在他 的<b>讲台</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.134043,0.602358,0.00466,0.011137\" data-n=\"6\" title=\"讲台\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(6)</sup></button> 前。","t01-02-1":"2. — 讲台左边立着一个带玻璃门的<b>柜子</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.188859,0.618736,0.008877,0.010481\" data-n=\"15\" title=\"柜子\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(15)</sup></button>。右边是 <b>黑板</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.016644,0.59679,0.003329,0.010481\" data-n=\"1\" title=\"黑板\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(1)</sup></button>，配着<b>板擦</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.034842,0.685228,0.005548,0.010154\" data-n=\"2\" title=\"板擦\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(2)</sup></button> 和 <b>粉笔</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.055704,0.744186,0.004882,0.010481\" data-n=\"3\" title=\"粉笔\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(3)</sup></button>。","t01-02-2":"讲台上方挂着几幅<b>挂图</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.042166,0.4887,0.00466,0.010481\" data-n=\"9\" title=\"挂图\" aria-expanded=\"false\">9</button>, <button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.097426,0.279725,0.007767,0.010481\" data-n=\"11\" title=\"挂图\" aria-expanded=\"false\">11</button>, <button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.170883,0.311824,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"12\" title=\"挂图\" aria-expanded=\"false\">12</button>)</sup> 和一幅<b>地图</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.117843,0.250901,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"10\" title=\"地图\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(10)</sup></button>。","t01-03-1":"3. — 并不是所有学生都在自己的<b>座位</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.290945,0.528005,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"17\" title=\"座位\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(17)</sup></button> 上。约翰 <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.006658,0.712414,0.00577,0.010481\" data-n=\"4\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(4)</sup></button> 站在黑板前；他拿着板擦，正在擦去那些<b>几何图形</b>。","t01-03-2":"彼得站在讲台旁；他正在收<b>书面作业</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.092543,0.64756,0.005104,0.010809\" data-n=\"5\" title=\"书面作业\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(5)</sup></button>，送给老师。","t01-04-1":"4. — <b>这位</b>老师是教<b>现代语言</b>的。他教学生说、读、写外语 <b>（德语、英语、西班牙语、意大利语、俄语</b>或<b>法语）</b>。","t01-05-1":"5. — 教室很大，也很明亮。尽头有一扇宽大的<b>窗户</b>，带两扇 <b>气窗</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.336662,0.236489,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"78\" title=\"气窗\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(78)</sup></button>，还有一道<b>玻璃门</b>，用来通风采光。","t01-05-2":"这间教室并不冷。屋子当中为了取暖，放着一个很好的<b>炉子</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.543054,0.73567,0.011984,0.010809\" data-n=\"46\" title=\"炉子\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(46)</sup></button>，连着它的<b>烟囱</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.506214,0.622666,0.010431,0.011464\" data-n=\"45\" title=\"烟囱\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(45)</sup></button>。","t01-05-3":"隔板上钉着<b>衣帽钩</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.908566,0.720275,0.009543,0.011464\" data-n=\"58\" title=\"衣帽钩\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(58)</sup></button>；学生的帽子和大衣挂在上面。","t01-tit-2":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">院子。</span>","t01-06-1":"6. — <b>时钟</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.781846,0.21225,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"63\" title=\"时钟\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(63)</sup></button> 指着九点五分。","t01-06-2":"<b>课间休息</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.38016,0.384212,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"76\" title=\"课间休息\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(76)</sup></button> 刚刚结束，课又开始了。休息是在 <b>院子</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.36285,0.442516,0.008655,0.010154\" data-n=\"75\" title=\"院子\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(75)</sup></button> 里过的。我们看见几个学生在玩。一位 <b>学监</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.419441,0.372093,0.011318,0.010481\" data-n=\"74\" title=\"学监\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(74)</sup></button> 在看着他们。","t01-07-1":"7. — 院子里还看得见另外几个人：<b>督学</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.400355,0.432689,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"73\" title=\"督学\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(73)</sup></button>、 <b>校长</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.47692,0.431379,0.008655,0.010809\" data-n=\"71\" title=\"校长\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(71)</sup></button> 和<b>教务主任</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.441411,0.428431,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"72\" title=\"教务主任\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(72)</sup></button>。","t01-07-2":"督学视察各学校，校长管理这所学校，教务主任督查学生的功课。","t01-07-3":"第四个人是<b>校工</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.33644,0.429414,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"77\" title=\"校工\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(77)</sup></button>。他腋下夹着一本册子，用来登记缺席 的人。","t01-08-1":"8. — 院子尽头是<b>体操器械</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.467599,0.393384,0.009543,0.009826\" data-n=\"70\" title=\"体操器械\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(70)</sup></button> 和<b>手工</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.559698,0.471995,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"69\" title=\"手工\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(69)</sup></button> 作坊。","t01-08-2":"图表右边隐约看得见<b>音乐</b>和<b>图画</b>的<b>教室</b>。","t01-tit-3":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">详细的描述。</span>","t01-tit-4":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">好学生。</span>","t01-09-1":"9. — 讲台右边第一条长凳上的学生是<b>亨利</b><button class=\"apel\" data-noto=\"zh-t01-noto-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\">(*)</button>、<b>斯蒂芬</b>和 <b>查理</b>。","t01-09-2":"亨利很专心，也很用功；他正在听老师讲。他桌上有一本<b>练习本</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.230581,0.868981,0.010209,0.011464\" data-n=\"28\" title=\"练习本\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(28)</sup></button>、一本<b>书</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.199068,0.863085,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"29\" title=\"书\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(29)</sup></button>、一本<b>词典</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.159565,0.891582,0.010874,0.011137\" data-n=\"30\" title=\"词典\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(30)</sup></button> 和一个<b>笔盒</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.214603,0.905011,0.009543,0.011137\" data-n=\"31\" title=\"笔盒\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(31)</sup></button>。他的书有许多 <b>页</b>；每一章有好几个<b>段落</b>，每一<b>行</b>有许多<b>词</b>。","t01-09-4":"他的同桌斯蒂芬 <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.291389,0.81035,0.012206,0.010154\" data-n=\"24\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(24)</sup></button> 很勤快。他正把下次要交的功课记在本子上。 他的<b>字</b>写得很漂亮。他的书合着。只看得见<b>封面</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.201287,0.804455,0.010431,0.010809\" data-n=\"27\" title=\"封面\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(27)</sup></button>。他旁边放着他的<b>圆规</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.21771,0.820832,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"26\" title=\"圆规\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(26)</sup></button>。","t01-09-5":"查理 <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.270084,0.730102,0.009987,0.011137\" data-n=\"23\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(23)</sup></button> 手里拿着书；他正把它翻开，再温习一遍功课。跟每个学生 一样，他面前放着一个<b>墨水瓶</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.241456,0.717982,0.011318,0.009826\" data-n=\"25\" title=\"墨水瓶\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(25)</sup></button>。他很听话。","t01-10-1":"10. — 下一张桌上坐着<b>路易、安东</b>和<b>保罗</b>。路易正在背他的 <b>功课</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.365291,0.645922,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"22\" title=\"功课\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(22)</sup></button>，回答老师的<b>问题</b>。安东 <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.329117,0.630855,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"21\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(21)</sup></button> 很不专心；老师有时甚至罚他。保罗 <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.334665,0.600721,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"20\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(20)</sup></button> 是个好 同伴，和气又肯帮忙。他很专心。","t01-tit-5":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">坏学生。</span>","t01-11-1":"11. — 亨利后面坐着<b>乔治</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.543276,0.87455,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"38\" title=\"乔治\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(38)</sup></button>。他不是个坏孩子，可是 <b>爱说话</b>、不专心，又坐不住。他的<b>轻浮</b>和<b>不听话</b>在 课上引起<b>混乱</b>，他常常该受一顿严厉的<b>告诫</b>。他的 <b>草稿本</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.486906,0.885686,0.009987,0.010809\" data-n=\"35\" title=\"草稿本\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(35)</sup></button> 很脏，他用<b>钢笔</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.513316,0.936456,0.011762,0.008516\" data-n=\"34\" title=\"钢笔\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(34)</sup></button> 在 上面弄出<b>墨渍</b>，所以老是要用<b>橡皮</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.478695,0.859155,0.010874,0.011137\" data-n=\"36\" title=\"橡皮\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(36)</sup></button>；他的 <b>书包</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.454949,0.912217,0.010431,0.012119\" data-n=\"33\" title=\"书包\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(33)</sup></button> 破了，因为他太不小心。他把<b>笔杆</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.496671,0.864723,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"37\" title=\"笔杆\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(37)</sup></button> 带到现代语言教室来做什么呢？","t01-11-2":"他的同桌埃德蒙 <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.53573,0.800852,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"39\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(39)</sup></button> 不喜欢他。埃德蒙确实有点儿懒，可是安静， 也坐得住。他不闲聊；只是他不听讲，宁愿去读<b>读本</b>里的<b>故事</b>。","t01-11-3":"这条长凳上第三个学生是<b>吕多维克</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.483577,0.767114,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"40\" title=\"吕多维克\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(40)</sup></button>。他很勤勉。他正在 一张白<b>纸</b>上写字。他面前摊着<b>吸墨纸</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.432091,0.739928,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"41\" title=\"吸墨纸\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(41)</sup></button>。","t01-12-1":"12. — 老师左边第二条长凳上的学生年纪很小。头一个，小<b>埃米尔</b>， 还不会好好写字；他带来他的<b>石板</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.45162,0.655421,0.011318,0.010481\" data-n=\"42\" title=\"石板\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(42)</sup></button>、他的<b>石笔</b> 和他的<b>海绵</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.437195,0.627252,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"43\" title=\"海绵\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(43)</sup></button>。","t01-12-2":"他旁边是<b>奥古斯特</b>和<b>贝尔纳</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.437195,0.591549,0.011984,0.009499\" data-n=\"44\" title=\"贝尔纳\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(44)</sup></button>。后者功课做得 好，可是<b>样子</b>很邋遢。","t01-13-1":"13. — 他们后面坐着三个<b>懒鬼</b>。<b>阿尔贝</b>不背功课。 <b>雅各</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.629161,0.611857,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"47\" title=\"雅各\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(47)</sup></button> 不听讲，倒睡着了。他的<b>懒惰</b>给他招来 <b>申斥</b>，甚至<b>处罚</b>。最后，<b>克里斯蒂安</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.679982,0.61153,0.009987,0.010154\" data-n=\"48\" title=\"克里斯蒂安\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(48)</sup></button> 太轻佻了。他<b>品行</b>不好，也不肯改。","t01-14-1":"14. — 他们的邻座却很守规矩。<b>欧内斯特</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.699956,0.702588,0.007989,0.010809\" data-n=\"51\" title=\"欧内斯特\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(51)</sup></button> 爱整齐、 守规矩；他总是用他的<b>尺</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.692632,0.793318,0.008877,0.010809\" data-n=\"50\" title=\"尺\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(50)</sup></button> 和他的<b>铅笔</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.671993,0.744841,0.010209,0.009171\" data-n=\"49\" title=\"铅笔\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(49)</sup></button>。他是<b>走读生</b>。","t01-14-2":"<b>弗朗西斯</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.780293,0.754012,0.009543,0.011137\" data-n=\"52\" title=\"弗朗西斯\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(52)</sup></button> 是<b>寄宿生</b>；他穿制服，在学校里吃 饭睡觉。他是个好<b>朋友</b>。","t01-14-3":"莫里斯正用他的<b>小刀</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.786951,0.886341,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"56\" title=\"小刀\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(56)</sup></button> 削他的<b>铅笔</b>；他很仔细。","t01-14-4":"他把书都带来了，他的<b>语法书</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.732801,0.892892,0.009543,0.010481\" data-n=\"55\" title=\"语法书\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(55)</sup></button>、他的<b>笔记本</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.709055,0.857845,0.011096,0.010481\" data-n=\"54\" title=\"笔记本\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(54)</sup></button>，还有一本<b>便笺簿</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.762761,0.880118,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"53\" title=\"便笺簿\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(53)</sup></button>。他的<b>书袋</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.930537,0.91451,0.010209,0.010809\" data-n=\"57\" title=\"书袋\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(57)</sup></button> 放在他身后的地上。","t01-14-5":"教室尽头的两张桌子坐的是<b>好学生</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.337772,0.507042,0.008433,0.010809\" data-n=\"19\" title=\"好学生\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(19)</sup></button>。","t01-tit-6":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">图画和音乐。</span>","t01-15-1":"15. — <b>图画教室</b>里，墙上挂着漂亮的<b>范本</b>，天花板上垂下一盏 带<b>灯罩</b>的<b>灯</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.975144,0.45922,0.009765,0.010809\" data-n=\"62\" title=\"灯\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(62)</sup></button>。<b>老师</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.81447,0.575827,0.009543,0.011464\" data-n=\"60\" title=\"老师\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(60)</sup></button> 很有耐心；他给学生改<b>画</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.891034,0.610219,0.007324,0.009826\" data-n=\"61\" title=\"画\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(61)</sup></button>，教他们照着<b>胸像</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.976476,0.514248,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"59\" title=\"胸像\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(59)</sup></button> 写生。","t01-16-1":"16. — <b>音乐教室</b>看着很有意思。在那里学认<b>乐谱</b>，唱写在 <b>五线谱</b>上的<b>音阶</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.753884,0.423845,0.011096,0.010481\" data-n=\"67\" title=\"音阶\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(67)</sup></button>（do、re、mi、fa、sol、 la、si = C. D. E. F. G. A. B.），认<b>谱号</b>，唱动听的<b>曲子</b>。 乐谱放在<b>谱架</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.640257,0.466099,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"65\" title=\"谱架\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(65)</sup></button> 上。一个学生在<b>弹钢琴</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.758766,0.510645,0.010652,0.010809\" data-n=\"64\" title=\"弹钢琴\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(64)</sup></button>，<b>音乐老师</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.699512,0.461513,0.009099,0.010809\" data-n=\"66\" title=\"音乐老师\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(66)</sup></button> 在<b>打拍子</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.725477,0.447101,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"68\" title=\"打拍子\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(68)</sup></button>。","t01-17-1":"17. — 隐约还看得见<b>手工</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.559698,0.471995,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"69\" title=\"手工\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(69)</sup></button> 作坊的一角，孩子们可以在 那里学刨木头、锉铁。并不是每所学校都有。","t01-tit-7":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">理科教室。</span>","t01-18-1":"18. — 数学老师教学生<b>几何、算术、算法</b>和<b>米制</b>。 在挂图上我们看得见主要的几何图形：<b>圆</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.019633,0.658661,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"圆\" aria-expanded=\"false\">a</button>)</sup>、 <b>正方形</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.052468,0.626557,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"正方形\" aria-expanded=\"false\">b</button>)</sup>、<b>三角形</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.049811,0.67077,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"三角形\" aria-expanded=\"false\">c</button>)</sup>、 <b>直线</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.035173,0.739874,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"直线\" aria-expanded=\"false\">d</button>)</sup>。","t01-18-2":"我们还看得见一道<b>算式</b>；它不是<b>加法</b>，不是<b>减法</b>， 也不是<b>乘法</b>：它是<b>除法</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.065565,0.676005,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"除法\" aria-expanded=\"false\">e</button>)</sup>。","t01-19-1":"19. — 在米制挂图上我们看得见：一根<b>米尺</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.052217,0.380286,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"米尺\" aria-expanded=\"false\">a</button>)</sup>、一架 <b>天平</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.015161,0.379639,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"天平\" aria-expanded=\"false\">b</button>)</sup> 和它的<b>砝码</b>、一<b>升</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.059978,0.343932,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"升\" aria-expanded=\"false\">e</button>)</sup>、一<b>十升</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.013372,0.258796,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"f\" title=\"十升\" aria-expanded=\"false\">f</button>)</sup>、一<b>分升</b>和一 <b>立方米</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.03224,0.324944,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"立方米\" aria-expanded=\"false\">d</button>)</sup>。","t01-19-2":"学生也学<b>博物</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.097426,0.279725,0.007767,0.010481\" data-n=\"11\" title=\"挂图\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(11)</sup></button> —— 动物学 <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.124098,0.290533,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"动物学\" aria-expanded=\"false\">a</button>)</sup>、植物学 <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.132317,0.3652,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"植物学\" aria-expanded=\"false\">b</button>)</sup>、地质学 <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.127443,0.431354,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"地质学\" aria-expanded=\"false\">c</button>)</sup> —— 和<b>历史</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.170883,0.311824,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"12\" title=\"挂图\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(12)</sup></button>。","t01-19-3":"柜子里放着<b>物理</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.188859,0.618736,0.008877,0.010481\" data-n=\"15\" title=\"柜子\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(15)</sup></button> 和<b>化学</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.230138,0.5755,0.009321,0.010481\" data-n=\"16\" title=\"化学\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(16)</sup></button> 的 仪器。","t01-19-4":"柜子上面放着：一个<b>球</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.189525,0.419915,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"14\" title=\"球\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(14)</sup></button>、一个<b>圆锥</b>和一个 <b>地球仪</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.175322,0.387815,0.010209,0.011464\" data-n=\"13\" title=\"地球仪\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(13)</sup></button>。","t01-19-5":"挂图上方挂着一幅<b>地图</b>，画着世界的五大部分：<b>欧洲</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.161802,0.143808,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"欧洲\" aria-expanded=\"false\">e</button>)</sup>、<b>亚洲</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.20951,0.166394,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"g\" title=\"亚洲\" aria-expanded=\"false\">g</button>)</sup>、<b>非洲</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.155821,0.230267,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"f\" title=\"非洲\" aria-expanded=\"false\">f</button>)</sup>、 <b>美洲</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.073486,0.101258,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"美洲\" aria-expanded=\"false\">a</button><button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.084585,0.148741,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"美洲\" aria-expanded=\"false\">b</button>)</sup> 和<b>大洋洲</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.209077,0.256781,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"h\" title=\"大洋洲\" aria-expanded=\"false\">h</button>)</sup>，还有两大 洋—— <b>太平洋</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.036213,0.146461,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"太平洋\" aria-expanded=\"false\">c</button>)</sup> 和<b>大西洋</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.116538,0.161832,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"大西洋\" aria-expanded=\"false\">d</button>)</sup>。 <span class=\"fil\"></span>"},"noto":{"t01-noto-1":"(*) 至于<i>名字</i>，我们也建议按拉丁形式转写。只有这样才能免去数不清 的异写。何况在 <i>Giovanni、Jean、Johann、Jan、Hans、John、Ivan</i> 之间又该怎么选呢？难道要另编一部名字词典不成？我们取拉丁语的主格，就说： <b>Ioannes, Ioanna; Iulius, Iulia; Iakobus; Andreas; Lukas.</b> （《完全语法》）。"}}
